---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Dental Membership Plans | No Insurance Needed | Fallbrook"
  description="Downtown Dental Studio offers affordable dental membership plans through DentalHQ. No waiting periods, no deductibles, no insurance claims. Join starting at $39/month. HSA & FSA accepted."
  pageType="business"
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-warm-500 to-warm-600">
    <div class="container-max section py-16 sm:py-20 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4 text-balance">
        Affordable Dental Membership Plans
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-warm-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        A dental membership plan is your ticket to affordable dental care. Instead of dealing with 
        the complexities of insurance, you pay an annual or monthly fee for preventative care and 
        enjoy discounted additional services.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-warm-200 mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Most HSA &amp; FSA cards accepted &middot; Coverage begins immediately upon enrollment 
        &middot; No waiting periods, deductibles, or insurance claims
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Plans -->
  <section class="container-max section">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">

      <!-- Child Wellness -->
      <div class="card-hover flex flex-col">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-dental-900 mb-2">Child Wellness Plan</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Ages 13 &amp; under</p>
        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-dental-700 mb-1">$39<span class="text-lg font-normal text-gray-400">/mo</span></p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6">or $395/year</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700 flex-1">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 2 Child cleanings per year</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Fluoride treatment with cleaning</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 2 Regular exams with cleaning</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Oral cancer screening with cleaning</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 1 set of routine X-rays per year</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 1 emergency exam with X-ray per year (as needed)</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Up to 15% off additional treatment</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Adult Wellness — MOST POPULAR -->
      <div class="card-hover flex flex-col border-2 border-warm-500 relative">
        <span class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-warm-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">MOST POPULAR</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-dental-900 mb-2">Adult Wellness Plan</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Annual savings: $300+</p>
        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-dental-700 mb-1">$59<span class="text-lg font-normal text-gray-400">/mo</span></p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6">or $595/year</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700 flex-1">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 2 Adult cleanings per year</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 2 Regular exams with cleaning</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Oral cancer screening with cleaning</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 1 set of routine X-rays per year</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 1 emergency exam with X-ray per year (as needed)</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Up to 15% off additional treatment</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Deep Clean Maintenance -->
      <div class="card-hover flex flex-col">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-dental-900 mb-2">Deep Clean Maintenance Plan</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">For ongoing periodontal care</p>
        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-dental-700 mb-1">$99<span class="text-lg font-normal text-gray-400">/mo</span></p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6">or $995/year</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700 flex-1">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 4 Periodontal Maintenance cleanings per year</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 1 Fluoride treatment per year</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 2 Regular exams with cleaning</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Oral cancer screening with cleaning</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 1 set of routine X-rays per year</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> 1 emergency exam with X-ray per year (as needed)</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Save 15% off scaling and root planing</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-leaf-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">✓</span> Up to 15% off additional treatment</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Family Discounts -->
    <div class="text-center mt-10">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-dental-700">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Family Discounts Available</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">
        3% off with 2 family members &middot; 5% off with 3 family members &middot; 8% off with 4 or more family members
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Important Notes -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 border-y border-gray-100">
    <div class="container-max section py-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-dental-900 mb-6 text-center">What You Should Know</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="card text-center">
          <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">⚡</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">No Waiting Periods</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Coverage begins immediately upon enrollment. No delays, no waiting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🛡️</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">No Deductibles</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Pay only for what you need. No complicated deductibles to meet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">📋</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">No Insurance Claims</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">No paperwork, no denials. This is a membership — not insurance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">💰</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">HSA &amp; FSA Accepted</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Most HSA and FSA cards accepted for membership payments.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-10 space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <p><strong>Important:</strong> This is <em>not</em> dental insurance — it's a membership program for prepaid dental services offered by our practice. Discounts do not cover procedures performed outside of this office.</p>
        <p>Some membership plans may have a one-time activation fee for monthly payments.</p>
        <p>After enrollment, please <a href="tel:4423177000" class="text-dental-700 font-semibold underline">call the office</a> to schedule your first appointment. Your membership becomes effective immediately.</p>
        <p>During your first visit, Dr. Gill and the team will confirm the best plan for your specific needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-dental-900 text-white">
    <div class="container-max py-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to Join?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-dental-200 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Enroll online in minutes. Choose your plan, sign up, and start saving immediately.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="https://app.dentalhq.com/accounts/signup/my-dentist/9803" 
           target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           class="btn-gold text-lg">
          Sign Up on DentalHQ →
        </a>
        <a href="tel:4423177000" class="btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10 text-lg">
          Call (442) 317-7000
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-dental-400 mt-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Existing members: <a href="https://app.dentalhq.com/accounts/login?id=9803" 
        target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white">Log in to your account</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
